    "text": "By Buch Funeral Home ,\n10 hours ago Bryan D. Rohrer, 52, of East Petersburg, passed away unexpectedly on Monday, June 29, 2026 at UPMC, Lititz. Born in Bloomsburg, he was the son of Dale husband of Sheri Rohrer of Conestoga and the late Carol Artz Rohrer Matthews. He was the loving husband of Kelly P. Kauffman Rohrer... Read full article",
